## Why This Is Asked
Tests building a low-latency, privacy-preserving NLP service with in-VPC explainability and PrivateLink access to a private data lake. It also probes rollout strategy and cost awareness.

## Key Concepts
- Low-latency NLP inference on a small multilingual LM
- In-container explainability (Integrated Gradients) within a VPC
- PrivateLink access to data lake and Redis cache in VPC
- Canary rollouts with rollback on latency drift or metric drop
- Cost controls and autoscaling policies

## Code Example
